ks, let\u2019s highlight the rewards on the top menu bar when they do the streaks. People tend to rush through and not read text, at least it\u2019s another chance to highlight what\u2019s happening with the streaks.**", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-07-22T10:57:59Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-01-23T07:20:30Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 822756, "labels": ["Hot Leo Issues"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-06-17T09:39:29Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-22T10:57:59Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/863", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1017", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1017", "number": 1017, "title": "Playtestcloud Improvement - Character Screen Tutorial should highlight the action item better", "description": "**Player clicks on the the text box instead of the character tab.** \n\n* **Need an arrow or** \n* **Change the text to say \u201cclick on the character menu below\u201d or** \n* **Show the character menu icon in the text.**\n\n![]([URL_50456])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-07-05T14:43:46Z", "completed_at": "2024-07-15T07:06:21Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-01-15T07:20:32Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 833068, "labels": ["Hot Leo Issues"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-06-17T09:41:52Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-15T07:06:22Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/865", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1019", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1019", "number": 1019, "title": "Playtestcloud Bug - Lock other inputs in bomb tile boost tutorial", "description": "Players can easily skip the bomb tile boost tutorial by clicking on somewhere else. It should be locked and the tutorial should end with the use of bomb tile. \n\n[[URL_50458])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-07-05T15:05:29Z", "completed_at": "2024-07-15T07:06:14Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-01-15T07:20:33Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 833068, "labels": ["Hot Leo Issues"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-06-17T10:05:55Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-15T07:06:14Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/867", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1020", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1020", "number": 1020, "title": "Playtestcloud Bug - Lock inputs for a half sec to show time booster tutorial", "description": "Players can easily skip the +15 min boost tutorial by clicking on somewhere else. It should be locked for a while and the tutorial should end a little bit later on through taps. Player couldn't understand what they get, how they get them and how to use them. \n\n[[URL_50459])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-07-15T09:04:58Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-01-16T07:20:34Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 832949, "labels": ["Hot Leo Issues"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-06-17T10:07:37Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-15T09:04:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/868", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1021", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1021", "number": 1021, "title": "Playtestcloud Bug - Lock other inputs in rewind tutorial", "description": "Players can easily skip the rewind tutorial by clicking on somewhere else. It should be locked and the tutorial should end with the use of rewind. \n\n[[URL_50460])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-07-08T11:49:01Z", "completed_at": "2024-07-08T15:04:55Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-01-09T07:20:31Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 842669, "labels": ["Hot Leo Issues"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-06-17T10:16:58Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-08T15:04:55Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/881", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1035", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1035", "number": 1035, "title": "Arrow Positioning - Memory game tutorial arrow points slightly off", "description": "Version : 0.1269 iOS\n\nIn memory game tutorial, the arrow pointing the minigame hub button points somewhere else with a minimal misalignment. \n\n![image.png]([URL_50469])\n\nExpected result should be moving the arrow a little bit left so that the visual issue can be resolved.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-07-08T11:48:49Z", "completed_at": "2024-07-15T07:06:20Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-01-15T07:20:32Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 833068, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-06-18T17:03:13Z", "updated_at": "2024-07-15T07:06:20Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1061", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1218", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1218", "number": 1218, "title": "Two New Tutorial Issue", "description": "* Gust of wind tutorial is a blocker because the faded area is persistent and no other actions are allowed.\n\n  [[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_5722].6360814.mp4]([URL_50717])\n* Bundle tile tutorial has the persistent text messages that is not hidden in the next steps. \n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50716])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-09-03T13:54:53Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 760659, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-08-27T14:22:12Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-10T15:24:35Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1068", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1224", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1224", "number": 1224, "title": "Magical gust is usable until the very first level that can break the flow.", "description": "Magical gust should be locked at the start of the game.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-09-03T14:02:50Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-03-11T07:30:37Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 760651, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-08-28T16:16:13Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-10T11:17:44Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1076", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1231", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1231", "number": 1231, "title": "Chapter 3 Level 3 has more bomb tile objective than the bombs in the puzzle", "description": "* Chapter 3 Level 3 has two bomb tile level objective while the board has only 1 bomb tile.\n\n![image.png]([URL_50730])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-09-03T13:32:58Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-03-11T07:30:37Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 760681, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-08-28T16:33:38Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-10T11:17:44Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1077", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1232", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1232", "number": 1232, "title": "Missing Translation Issues on the new tutorials", "description": "* Magical gust tutorial\n\n  [1000000394.mp4]([URL_50734])\n* Train and gust milestone preview has a missing translation.\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50733])\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50732])\n* Bundle tile tutorial has a missing translation.\n\n  [1000000398.mp4]([URL_50731])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-09-09T18:27:58Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-03-10T07:20:19Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 751746, "labels": ["Baklava Release", "Submission Blocker", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-08-28T16:36:37Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-09T18:27:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1160", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-131", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-25", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-131", "number": 131, "title": "New Algo Implementation", "description": "[PERSON_NAME_0040] to update GDD with meeting discussion on algo.\n\nOnce reviewed, we link it here so [PERSON_NAME_0029] can quickly reference the discussion and have it ready by next Wednesday play test. (Aug 16th)", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": "2023-08-16", "started_at": "2023-08-07T21:27:22Z", "completed_at": "2023-08-28T18:05:33Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1296089, "labels": ["Sprint 1 - August 18th", "Improvement", "Mini Game"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-08-07T19:42:09Z", "updated_at": "2023-08-28T18:05:33Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1262", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1404", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1404", "number": 1404, "title": "Chapter 2 is unlocked with 14 levels", "description": "It was a fix to prevent potential blockers that players might experience in FTUE. Do we want to keep that as is for baklava hot fix or desire? \n\n![image.png]([URL_51012])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-09-27T07:52:36Z", "completed_at": "2024-09-29T15:09:16Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 723145, "labels": ["Baklava Hot Fix", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-09-12T18:46:01Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-29T15:09:16Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1283", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1424", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1424", "number": 1424, "title": "Streamline Tutorial Copywriting and Clean Up Localization Files (English and Spanish)", "description": "Review and make the tutorial copywriting more concise in the localization files. \n\nThe localization file is here: [[URL_51036])\n\nThis includes cleaning up both the English and Spanish versions to ensure clarity and consistency. The goal is to make the text more concise while maintaining the original intent and tone of the tutorial.", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-10-14T18:05:00Z", "completed_at": "2024-11-13T15:36:07Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 677317, "labels": ["Easy Fix - Just do it!", "Lava Hot Fix"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-09-13T17:50:19Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-02T17:19:04Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1287", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1428", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1428", "number": 1428, "title": "Compile List of Delayed Highlighting in Tutorials for Timely Adjustments", "description": "In some tutorials, the highlighting effect appears too late during the dimming/highlighting sequence. We need to compile a list of all moments where this occurs, so adjustments can be made to ensure the highlighting appears at the appropriate time, improving tutorial clarity and user experience.\n\n**Known instances**\n\n* Second tile highlight in the streak tutorial - CHAPTER 1 LEVEL 4\n\n[Record_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_5752]_0ed2d384a7e28d6134e98d8e5c97b585.mp4]([URL_51048])\n\n* Jumbo tile highlight in the jumbo tile tutorial - CHAPTER 1 LEVEL 8\n\n[RPReplay_Final1726491834.mov]([URL_51047])\n\n* Character tile highlight in the character token tutorial - CHAPTER 1 LEVEL 10\n\n[RPReplay_Final1726491953.MP4]([URL_51046])\n\n* Upgrade button highlight in the character screen tutorial - CHAPTER 1 AFTER LEVEL 10\n\n[RPReplay_Final1726491981.MP4]([URL_51045])\n\n* Tile dozer minigame highlight & home button highlight in the minigame hub tutorial - CHAPTER 1 AFTER LEVEL 12\n\n[RPReplay_Final1726492076.MP4]([URL_51044])\n\n* Chapter 2 highlight in the chapter completion tutorial - CHAPTER 1 AFTER LEVEL 15 \n\n[RPReplay_Final1726492864.MP4]([URL_51043])\n\n* Unlit bomb tile, tile with fire symbol, and lit bomb tile highlights in the bomb tile tutorial - CHAPTER 2 LEVEL 2\n\n[RPReplay_Final1726492945.MP4]([URL_51042])\n\n* Vanishing tile highlight in the vanishing tile tutorial - CHAPTER 2 LEVEL 11\n\n[RPReplay_Final1726493310.MP4]([URL_51041])\n\n* Bundle tile highlight in the train level/ bundle tile tutorial - CHAPTER 3 LEVEL 9\n\n[RPReplay_Final1726494111.mov]([URL_51040])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2024-10-01T14:36:41Z", "archived_at": "2025-04-02T07:35:18Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 720298, "labels": ["Baklava Hot Fix", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-09-13T18:01:18Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-01T14:36:41Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1403", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1533", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_63fffeb4fab5233e", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1533", "number": 1533, "title": "Disable shop access during tutorial dialogue interaction", "description": "'@Leonard said:\n\n> I got stuck in tutorial ch 2 level 1 pre-level dialogue because I clicked on the boosts, it took me to the shop but the tutorial continued. We need to disable going to the shop. It should highlight but tapping highlighting area should act like a tap any there to continue action. I think there was a ticket on this but I\u2019m gonna recreate.\n\n![IMG_8108.PNG]([URL_51198])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-09-28T16:48:21Z", "completed_at": "2024-10-04T17:57:25Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-04-05T07:35:34Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 715777, "labels": ["Submission Blocker", "Baklava Hot Fix"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-09-25T23:56:20Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-04T17:57:25Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1489", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1612", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1612", "number": 1612, "title": "The tutorial text issues and missing translations icons for milestone previews", "description": "* The level 1 tutorial texts are the old ones.\n\n  [RPReplay_Final1727859941.MP4]([URL_51304])\n* Level 5 +3 boost tutorial has missing translations for both texts.\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_51303])\n* Level 6 level objective tutorial has the old text\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_51302])\n* The rectangle overlap still visible in jumbo tile tutorial level \n\n  ![image.png]([URL_51301])\n* Missing translation on lucky drop milestone & its icon should be added\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_51300])\n* We still unlock every minigame at ch2 lvl6\n* Vanishing tile milestone icon isn't up-to date.\n* Quest milestone has the old icon.\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_51299])\n  1. quests are unlocked at level 15 without any tutorial\n\n     [RPReplay_Final1727861919.MP4]([URL_51298])\n  2. then after level 16 it's tutorial started.\n\n     [RPReplay_Final1727862006.MP4]([URL_51297])\n* River tile has missing translation.\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_51296])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-10-04T10:07:35Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-04-10T07:35:19Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 716247, "labels": ["Desire Release", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-10-02T14:20:08Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-09T15:13:08Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1582", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1699", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1699", "number": 1699, "title": "Vanishing Tutorial might be disrupted by drawing a tile", "description": "Vanishing tile tutorial let me draw tiles so if I draw tile before the tutorial kicks in, the tutorial is blocking me because of the mistime highlights. \n\n[Record_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_5835].mp4]([URL_51401])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-10-17T09:39:56Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 697554, "labels": ["Lava Hot Fix", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-10-10T16:35:05Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-17T09:39:56Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1598", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1712", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1712", "number": 1712, "title": "Milestone Preview Wording Issues", "description": "* The lucky drop milestone preview has missing translation.\n\n  ![Screenshot_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_5844]-34_64875109357c738d09c3691cefc5a1e4.jpg]([URL_51419])\n* \"Train\" milestone should be updated as \"Train Adventure\". \n* Vanishing Tiles needs the new icon\n* Missing Translation on Luckdrop", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-10-14T19:55:14Z", "completed_at": "2024-10-15T14:19:52Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-04-16T07:35:27Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 700154, "labels": ["Lava Hot Fix"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-10-14T17:38:04Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-15T14:19:52Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1649", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1766", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1766", "number": 1766, "title": "Boost stays locked after Vanishing Tile Tutorial is interrupted", "description": "## Version or date: \n\nios 2.197\n\n## Description: \n\nIf a player killed the app during the vanishing tile tutorial, the gold and bomb boost stays locked. It's unlocked within the tutorial, however it's not stay as unlocked in later levels. \n\n## Visual References:\n\n[RPReplay_Final1729772309.MP4]([URL_51494])\n\n## Expected Outcome:\n\nis to make sure that the locked boosts during the tutorial should be unlocked regardless of the tutorial condition \n\n## Steps to Repro:\n\n1. Start ch2-lvl11\n2. Kill the app during the tutorial\n3. Open the app again \n4. Complete the level\n5. Observe that the boosts stays locked\n\n##", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-12-26T14:56:16Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 596438, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-10-24T14:19:20Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-26T14:56:16Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1650", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1767", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1767", "number": 1767, "title": "The first 3 level tutorials breaks FTUE while killing the app during level complete", "description": "## Version or date: \n\n0.2.197\n\n## Description:\n\nThe first 3 tutorials which are the chain tutorials that would trigger the next level  on another. If the app is killed at the level complete text (before the win screen) in any of those levels, the next session starts in the saga map. \n\nIf those levels are opened via saga map, then the tutorials are not re-triggered. That creates FTUE problems where level 3 can be failed without proper tutorial on how to use gold tiles etc.\n\n## Visual References:\n\n[RPReplay_Final1729675355.MP4]([URL_51497])\n\n[RPReplay_Final1729845397.MP4]([URL_51496])\n\nIn the bookmark wild tile tutorial, Sophie's streak rewards are granted so players can draw a tile and interrupt the sequence. \u2b07\ufe0f \n\n[RPReplay_Final1729845508.MP4]([URL_51495])\n\n## Expected Outcome: \n\nWe should either mark level as completed during that level complete texts or should have a fallback strategy to retrigger those tutorials. \n\n## Steps to Repro:\n\n1. Start playing level 1, 2, or 3\n2. Complete tutorials\n3. Finish levels\n4. Kill the app before being directed to the win screen (during the level complete text and confetti)\n\n##", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-11-01T10:58:11Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 675876, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-10-24T15:11:43Z", "updated_at": "2024-11-01T10:58:11Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1678", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1792", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1792", "number": 1792, "title": "FTUE 3.0 Revamp", "description": "Hardcoded FTUE portions:\n\n* Player on rails to end of level 10 (Auto start), players do not see saga map until after level 10 collecting hero tokens and upgrading their character\n* Remove gold tile tutorial at level 3\n* Remove +3 tile tutorial until later chapter\n* Remove rewind tutorial until later chapter\n* Chapter 1 transition with saga map changes (infinite scrollable), applies to all chapter Saga maps (discuss with [PERSON_NAME_0054] and Marcus)", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-12-30T11:56:25Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 590858, "labels": ["Sprint 25 Destiny - Nov 8th"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ENG-1794", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-10-28T18:18:29Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-30T11:56:25Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1681", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1795", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1794", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1795", "number": 1795, "title": "Clean up the current bookmarks", "description": "Clean up any event boxes that adhere to the bookmark", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-12-30T11:56:44Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 590858, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-10-28T18:36:23Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-30T11:56:44Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1683", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1797", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1794", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1797", "number": 1797, "title": "Remove early tutorials later down the funnel", "description": "Wildcard and +3 booster", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-12-30T11:57:13Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 590857, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-10-28T18:38:16Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-30T11:57:13Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1684", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1798", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-1794", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1798", "number": 1798, "title": "Update Milestone Preview And Notifications", "description": null, "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-12-30T11:57:08Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 590857, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-10-28T18:38:50Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-30T11:57:08Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1713", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1823", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1823", "number": 1823, "title": "Nate select tutorial doesn't highlight Nate", "description": "Version or date: ios 281\n\n### Description: \n\nThe Nate select tutorial triggered at ch3 level 1 is not highlighting nate's icon in the prelevel dialogue.\n\n### Visual References:\n\n![image.png]([URL_51560])\n\n### Expected Outcome: is to highlight the character icon. \n\n### Steps to Repro:\n\n1. Finish chapter 2 level 20, obtain nate token\n2. Got to the next chapter\n3. Observe that no highlight appears.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2024-12-04T19:38:18Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 627836, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-04T16:01:53Z", "updated_at": "2024-12-04T19:38:18Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1845", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-1942", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-1942", "number": 1942, "title": "Remaining [PERSON_NAME_0036] FTUE Issues", "description": "Version or date: testflight ios 0.80\n\n### Description: \n\n1. 1-3 is losable - force quit\n\n   ![image.png]([URL_51693])\n2. 1-6 losable badly - at least boosters unlocked \n\n   ![image.png]([URL_51692])\n3. Minigames can be accessible through quests even before unlocking them.\n\n   [RPReplay_Final1732722096.MP4]([URL_51691])", "priority": 1, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-03-17T11:18:51Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 480015, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-11-27T17:32:25Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-17T11:18:51Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1962", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2049", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2049", "number": 2049, "title": "Draw tile tutorial came later than level 4", "description": "Version or date: android 0.2.1044\n\n### Description: \n\n### The draw tile tutorial comes at level 6 but level 4 and 5, players need to draw tiles so the tutorial is pointless at that position. \n\n![image.png]([URL_51934])\n\n![image.png]([URL_51933])\n\n### Expected Outcome: is to change level 6 into level 4 by updating the tutorial as well.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-16T18:25:34Z", "completed_at": "2025-01-20T16:56:12Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 560318, "labels": ["Sprint 28 - January 17th", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-01-08T14:27:31Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-20T16:56:12Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/1965", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-2051", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-2051", "number": 2051, "title": "The streak tutorial can be broken by fast click", "description": "Version or date: ios 837\n\n### Description: \n\nThe streak tutorial has the message box with duration-based trigger.  So if the streak is achieved before 2 sec where the message is still visible, the tutorial is stuck.\n\n![image.png]([URL_51940])\n\n### Visual References:\n\n[ScreenRecording_[CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER_5996]_1.mov]([URL_51939])\n\n### Expected Outcome: is to set the streak tile correct by changing the nodes trigger like the screenshot above.\n\n### Steps to Repro:\n\n1. Reach level 7\n2. Match the tiles really fast before the message box disappears\n3. Observe that the streak tile is not set as intended", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-01-16T18:25:31Z", "completed_at": "2025-01-20T14:23:22Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 560471, "labels": ["Easy Fix - Just do it!", "Sprint 28 - January 17th", "Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-01-10T15:43:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-20T14:23:22Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2437", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-302", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-302", "number": 302, "title": "Persistent error in parent child relationship resulting to too many revealed pieces", "description": "'@[PERSON_NAME_0054] said:\n\n> Persistent error in parent child relationship resulting to too many revealed pieces\n\nThis is level 32, or Chapter 2 level 2.\n\n![image.png]([URL_49965])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-01-03T07:02:09Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 1112432, "labels": ["Bug", "Main Game"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2023-10-15T22:21:56Z", "updated_at": "2024-03-06T21:33:38Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2902", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-738", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-738", "number": 738, "title": "Jumbo-tile Tutorial", "description": "* jumbo-tile needs basic tutorial per our discussion (need tutorial text and we need to move it down to level 7)", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-17T19:33:33Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T11:10:30Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-19T05:45:59Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 959544, "labels": ["Django Blocker"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-15T22:01:47Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T13:56:12Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2923", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-762", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-762", "number": 762, "title": "5- & 6-Streak Tutorials", "description": "* Need to add 5-streak and 6-streak tutorial text boxes to level 4 tutorial.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-04-19T13:08:16Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-20T05:45:57Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 957986, "labels": ["Django Blocker"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-15T21:39:05Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-19T13:08:16Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2924", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-763", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-763", "number": 763, "title": "Tutorial Text Repositioning", "description": "* Move the text tutorial so the tile is not blocked?\n  * \n\n    ![image.png]([URL_50163])\n* *We need to move the text tutorial down closer to the middle of the screen. It\u2019s unnecessarily away and close to the top of the screen.*\n  * \n\n    ![image.png]([URL_50162])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-17T19:32:45Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T11:04:10Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-19T05:46:00Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 959550, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-15T21:58:02Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T11:04:10Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2925", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-764", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-764", "number": 764, "title": "Character Token Tutorial", "description": "*  Character token needs extra tutorial step telling what it is and saying \u201cyey finish the level to get it\u201d", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-18T18:37:56Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-19T09:45:00Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2025-03-11T07:30:35Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 958189, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-15T22:02:48Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-19T09:45:00Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2927", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-766", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-766", "number": 766, "title": "Jumbo Tile Tutorial Fix", "description": "* Jumbo tile text overlaps with the arrow and the tile you need to remove. we need to move it. I think is also needs better text. Jumbotiles are just like any other tiles but bigger. You can match any side. Pay attention to how it flips", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-17T13:45:44Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T11:10:39Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-19T05:45:59Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 959544, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-15T22:06:49Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T11:10:39Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2929", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-768", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-768", "number": 768, "title": "Level 30 has a P/C problem.", "description": "* **Summary:** Level 30 puzzle layout has parent/child problem.\n* **Description:** The left part beneath the bomb tile requires adjustment, causing confusion or hindrance to gameplay.\n* **Steps to Reproduce:** Play Level 30 and observe the left part beneath the bomb tile.\n* **Expected Result:** Puzzle layout should be visually clear and logically aligned.\n* **Actual Result:** Misaligned or color inconsistent left part beneath the bomb tile.\n* **Additional Information:**\n  * Screenshot: [Link]([URL_15894])\n  * Version: 0.1.824\n  * Device: iPhone 11\n  * Date: 04.16.2024", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-17T13:34:09Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T12:24:02Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-19T05:45:54Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 959470, "labels": ["Submission Blocker"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-16T19:05:27Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T12:24:02Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2930", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-769", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-769", "number": 769, "title": "The text is too long at the level 1", "description": "**Summary:** Bubble text too long in first tutorial (iPhone 11 - Version 0.1.824)\n\n**Description:** The text in the bubble is too long in the first tutorial on iPhone 11 (Version 0.1.824), leading to readability issues.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\n\n1. Play level 1.\n\n**Expected Behavior:** The bubble text should be refined or divided into two for better readability on iPhone 11.\n\n[[URL_50174])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-18T16:17:55Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T16:43:56Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-19T05:45:54Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 959210, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-16T19:29:14Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T16:43:56Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2935", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-773", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-773", "number": 773, "title": "P/C in Chapter 2 Level 3 with the bomb tile.", "description": "**Summary:** Parent/child issue with Bomb tile functionality on Chapter 2 Level 3 (iPhone 11 - Version 0.1.836)\n\n**Description:** On Chapter 2 Level 3 of the iPhone 11 (Version 0.1.836), there is a parent/child issue related to the Bomb tile functionality. Specifically, the Bomb tile is not covering the tile beneath as expected.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\n\n1. Play Chapter 2 Level 3.\n2. Observe the Bomb tile functionality.\n\n**Expected Behavior:** The Bomb tile should cover the tile beneath it, functioning correctly on Chapter 2 Level 3 of the game on iPhone 11.\n\n[Chapter 2 Level 3 P/C Issue.PNG]([URL_15881],)\n[Chapter 2 Level 3 Bomb tile function issue.PNG]([URL_15873])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-17T17:19:52Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T12:37:58Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-19T05:45:53Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 959456, "labels": ["Submission Blocker", "Django Blocker"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-17T14:57:30Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T12:37:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2954", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-790", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-790", "number": 790, "title": "Bomb tile tutorial bug- Dimming stayf after the match", "description": "**Summary:** Bomb tile tutorial malfunction on iPhone 11 (Version 0.1.846)\n\n**Description:** On iPhone 11 (Version 0.1.846), the bomb tile tutorial is not functioning properly during level 21. After clicking on the bomb tile, the dimmed area remains visible, and the tutorial is not completed as expected.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\n\n1. Play level 21.\n2. Encounter the bomb tile tutorial.\n3. Click on the bomb tile.\n\n**Expected Behavior:** After clicking on the bomb tile during the tutorial, the dimmed area should disappear, and the tutorial should be completed successfully on iPhone 11.\n\n[Bomb tile tutorial bug -dim stays.mp4]([URL_15870])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-18T15:18:24Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T15:53:26Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-19T05:46:00Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 959261, "labels": ["Django Blocker"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-18T14:54:26Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T15:53:37Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2957", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-793", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-793", "number": 793, "title": "Visual P/C Issue on Chapter 2 Level 19", "description": "**Summary:** Potential parent/child issue on Chapter 2 Level 19 on iPhone 11 (Version 0.1.846)\n\n**Description:** On iPhone 11 (Version 0.1.846), Chapter 2 Level 19 appears to have a potential parent/child issue. This may be causing visual inconsistencies or irregularities in the level.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\n\n1. Play Chapter 2 Level 19.\n\n**Expected Behavior:** The level should display properly without any visual inconsistencies or irregularities on iPhone 11.\n\n[Chapter2 Lv19 looks like it has p/c issue.PNG]([URL_15867])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-18T18:07:26Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-18T18:30:41Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-19T05:45:55Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 959104, "labels": ["Django Blocker"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-18T15:22:25Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-18T18:30:41Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2958", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-794", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-794", "number": 794, "title": "'+3 booster doesn't force to use +3 booster", "description": "**Summary:** +3 booster tutorial does not enforce tapping on the +3 booster on iPhone 11 (Version 0.1.849)\n\n**Description:** On iPhone 11 (Version 0.1.849), the +3 booster tutorial fails to enforce tapping on the +3 booster as expected.\n\n**Steps to Reproduce:**\n\n1. Play a level after 5.\n2. Finish all moves.\n3. Tap on somewhere else instead of the +3 booster.\n\n**Expected Behavior:** The +3 booster tutorial should enforce tapping on the +3 booster, guiding the player to use it as intended on iPhone 11.\n\n[+3 tutorial doesn't force to interact.mp4]([URL_48107])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-18T19:40:00Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-19T09:18:36Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-20T05:45:56Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 958216, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-18T16:15:38Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-19T09:18:36Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2966", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-801", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-801", "number": 801, "title": "Jumbo tile tutorial needs a little delay with inputblocker", "description": "Jumbo tile tutorial needs a little delay like 0.5 to 2 with inputblocker since rn it might disappear without giving players to proper chance to read it.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-19T18:00:50Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-22T11:39:55Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-23T06:02:10Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 953754, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-19T16:15:20Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-22T11:39:55Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2977", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-811", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-811", "number": 811, "title": "Make level 26 & 27 vanishing tile levels", "description": "In order to explain the function of vanishing tiles, there should be b2b vanishing tile levels to teach every feature related to it.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-22T14:59:25Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-22T15:46:13Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-23T06:02:09Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 953508, "labels": ["FTUE"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-22T10:32:35Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-22T15:46:13Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2983", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-817", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-817", "number": 817, "title": "Jumbo tile tutorial Arrow Location Fix", "description": "The arrow to indicate jumbo tile in the tutorial (chapter 1 level 8) is blocking the matching symbol. It should be relocated to somewhere near to highlight the peripherals of the jumbo tile rather than its center. \n\nVersion: 0.885\n\n**Steps to Repro**\n\n1. Play level 8\n2. Start the tutorial\n3. Observe the arrows location\n\n[[URL_50212])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-04-23T21:30:06Z", "completed_at": "2024-04-24T10:51:04Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-25T06:10:31Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 950923, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-22T16:01:30Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-24T12:01:44Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/2994", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-827", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-827", "number": 827, "title": "Tutorial Improvements - Char Upgrade Text Change / Input Blocker for Streak", "description": "'- [ ] Streak tutorial at level 4 has some texts that can be skipped easily. Please consider adding minimal input blocker for those texts without any highlight etc. \n- [ ] The other thing is about text adjustment for character upgrade tutorial. It needs to be changed to ***\"Character Tokens can be found throughout Tiliaterra, use them to unlock and upgrade characters!\"***  for a coherent tutorial language***.***\n  * pls let's discuss it first about the texts of tutorials then start taking actions.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-06-17T11:55:08Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-12-18T07:20:55Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 873099, "labels": ["Improvement"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-24T11:44:09Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-17T11:55:08Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3002", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-835", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-835", "number": 835, "title": "Assign objectives for the levels after chapter 2", "description": "Objectives are not assigned to levels from chapter 3 to 10. Once they are assigned, prelevel objectives will appear.", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-04-25T12:55:32Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-10-26T06:20:28Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 949359, "labels": ["Django Blocker"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-24T18:50:29Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-25T12:55:32Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3008", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-840", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-840", "number": 840, "title": "Objective Visual Bug - Level 2 objective shows 2 stars achieved but gives 3 stars", "description": "**Version: 0.914**\n\n**Device : iphone11**\n\nThe level 2 tutorial override the level accomplishment as 3 stars but it looks like we're getting 2 stars visually. The streak objective should be adjusted to 6 to 8 rather than 8-12. \n\n![image.png]([URL_50237])\n\n**Expected Outcome:**\n\nThe objective panel should look like 3-star objective is accomplished with the tick. \n\n**Steps to Repro**\n\n1. Launch the game\n2. Play the level 2 for the first time", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-05-01T15:39:04Z", "completed_at": "2024-05-01T18:33:58Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-11-02T06:20:37Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 940380, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-26T14:29:24Z", "updated_at": "2024-05-01T18:33:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3009", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-841", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-841", "number": 841, "title": "Level Layout Bugs - P/C Issues along with visual issues", "description": "'- [X] Chapter 3 Level 7\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50264])\n\n\n- [X] Chapter 3 Level 8\n\n![image.png]([URL_50263])\n\n- [X] Chapter 4 Level 4 - Slight Visual Bug\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50262])\n- [X] Chapter 4 Level 14 - Slight Visual Asymmetry \n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50261])\n- [X] Chapter 4 Level 23 - Slight Visual Issue on 4/0 tile\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50260])\n- [X] Chapter 4 Level 24 - Visual P/C Issue due to perspective\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50259])\n- [X] Chapter 4 Level 26 - P/C Issue\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50258])\n- [X] Chapter 5 Level 3 - tiles are too close\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50257])\n- [X] Chapter 5 Level 14 - P/C Issue\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50256])\n- [X] Chapter 5 Level 28 - P/C Issue\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50255])\n- [X] Chapter 5 Level 30 - Upper tiles are too close \n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50254])\n- [X] Chapter 6 Level 26 - upper left tail is too close looks like it below the central cluster\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50253])\n- [X] Chapter 6 Level 28 - Too close tiles\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50252])\n- [X] Chapter 7 Level 13 - P/C Issue\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50251])\n- [X] Chapter 7 Level 19 - P/C Issue\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50250])\n- [X] Chapter 8 Level 21 - 3/2 parent tile should be more clear for the child tile.\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50249])\n- [X] Chapter 8 Level 22 - P/C Issue\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50248])\n- [X] Chapter 8 Level 26 - Many tiles are too close to each other. Clover/0 parent child is not clear. \n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50247])\n- [X] Chapter 8 Level 27 - Tiles are too close\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50246])\n- [X] Chapter 9 Level 7 - Central cluster has visual P/C issue (looks like the close tiles are parents of other cluster. \n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50245])\n- [X] Chapter 9 Level 8 - Small Visual P/C Issue - move upper tail a little more up\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50244])\n- [X] Chapter 9 Level 22 - Minor Visual P/C mushroom/clover and 1/0 are too close.\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50243])\n- [X] Chapter 9 Level 29 - P/C Issue\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50242])\n- [X] Chapter 10 Level 2 - Too close placement\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50241])\n- [X] Chapter 10 Level 11 - The pointed tile looks like it's not parent of the tile below.  \n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50240])\n- [X] Chapter 10 Level 23 - P/C Issue\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50239])\n- [X] Chapter 10 Level 25 - 2/1 parenthood is not clear\n\n  ![image.png]([URL_50238])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-04-30T18:16:15Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-11-02T06:20:36Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 941838, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-26T14:39:38Z", "updated_at": "2024-05-01T10:55:19Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3011", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-843", "project_id": null, "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-843", "number": 843, "title": "Chapter 5 Level 16 has no prelevel objective", "description": "![image.png]([URL_50269])", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-04-30T18:16:13Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": "2024-11-01T06:20:22Z", "time_in_status_minutes": 941838, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": true, "created_at": "2024-04-29T12:23:12Z", "updated_at": "2024-04-30T18:16:13Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3016", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-848", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-848", "number": 848, "title": "Tutorial Editor To-Do List for Leonardo", "description": "Please see the sub-issues for each specific task.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-05-06T17:51:48Z", "completed_at": "2024-09-29T11:06:09Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 723388, "labels": ["Sprint 19 - June 14th", "Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-29T17:17:09Z", "updated_at": "2024-09-29T11:06:09Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3032", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-864", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-848", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-864", "number": 864, "title": "Tag for Match Counter", "description": "![]([URL_50285])\n\nNeed a tag for the Match Counter in CB game.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2024-06-06T15:50:40Z", "completed_at": "2024-06-06T15:50:57Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 888703, "labels": ["Tutorial Editor"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-04-30T18:28:20Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-06T15:51:07Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3141", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-969", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-969", "number": 969, "title": "Bug: Players can still draw the earned card in the streak reward tutorial level", "description": "'@[PERSON_NAME_0054] said:\n\n> We didn't lock them from drawing the card they earned on the streak reward tutorial level\n\nIf they draw a card, they are stuck in the level and have to settings quit.", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2024-06-17T13:06:16Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 873028, "labels": ["Bug"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-05-29T01:42:02Z", "updated_at": "2024-06-17T13:06:17Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3147", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ENG-974", "project_id": "1061a4f4-bc6a-45ca-a5b6-7f73d5e0abe2", "team_id": "team_ENG", "parent_id": "ENG-973", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ENG-974", "number": 974, "title": "Unlock infinite rewind from tutorial system", "description": "Locking unlocking as needed", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-01-16T18:44:26Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 565982, "labels": ["Avengers"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2024-05-30T19:39:48Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-16T18:44:26Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3515", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-390", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_65c76e0b87aa7e9b", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-390", "number": 390, "title": "Icon and Event Visual for Win Streak Event (axe arena)", "description": "An event about win streak multiplier. \n\nAs you continue to win levels, the score multiplier increases and after every level win players will win more scores. When they lose, the multiplier resets to x1. The event will last 2 days and top players will be rewarded based on the score collected. \n\nSo I'm thinking something contains \"deadeye\" to emphasize the winning streak with accuracy plus the zombie theme. Here is the potential names: \n\n1. Deadeye Carnage\n2. Deadeye Tournament\n3. Deadeye Rampage\n4. Deadeye Run\n5. Chain the Dead\n6. One Shot, One Kill\n\n![image.png]([URL_52696])\n\n![]([URL_52695])\n\n **Here is the potential prompt**\n\n* **Event Icon Prompt (Badge/Icon Format)**\n\nA bold 2D cartoon-style digital illustration designed for a mobile game event icon. The image features a colorful target with concentric blue, red, and cream rings, with a glossy zombie eyeball at the center. The target is positioned on the left, while three angry green zombie heads with glowing yellow eyes are stacked to the right, each drawn with sharp outlines and exaggerated expressions. The color palette is vibrant, and the shadows are clean and game-ready. The art has a playful but slightly menacing tone, fitting a zombie-themed casual RPG. There is no text, and the icon is centered with transparent or dark neutral background for layering on various UI.\n\n* **Main Event Page Visual Prompt (Hero Image Format)**\n\nA wide-format 2D digital illustration in a polished cartoon style, meant for a mobile game event screen. On the left side is a large red-blue-cream target with a detailed zombie eyeball in the center. To the right, three fierce green zombie heads are stacked with glowing yellow eyes and sharp facial shadows. The background is a dark brown gradient with light texture to add depth without distraction. The layout is balanced for mobile UI design, leaving space for overlayed buttons or text. The tone is energetic and competitive, capturing the spirit of a limited-time win streak event where precision and momentum matter. No text is included in the image.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 306850, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-07-15T13:49:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-15T17:24:27Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3525", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-40", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-73", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_Robert", "state_id": "Canceled", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-40", "number": 40, "title": "Experiment With Different Object Sizes", "description": "As a part of the visual gameplay improvement, we're resizing the objects to fit the gameplay better. So far, we decided on: \n\n1. Items will be sized based on tap area (real estate on the board)\n2. When items are resized according to one another, it's not ideal because we lost the range we need. \n3. Progress and system design on\n   [https://www.figma.com/design/TvRw8na5iGd3NynbSRUGFy/Zombie-Match-3D?node-id=1509-2&p=f&t=WWTpY83kvHQI9rzm-0](https://www.figma.com/design/TvRw8na5iGd3NynbSRUGFy/Zombie-Match-3D?node-id=1509-2&p=f&t=WWTpY83kvHQI9rzm-0)", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-04-21T16:20:56Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": "2025-06-13T01:19:32Z", "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 353895, "labels": ["(ZM) Game Design"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-21T16:20:56Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-13T01:19:32Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3730", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-59", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-59", "number": 59, "title": "Create Test Levels For Object Composition", "description": "We want to test the current resize on tap area logic. \n\n1. Creating a range of Unity primitives based on tap real estate on the board\n   (Baseline range)\n2. Levels where primitives and resembling objects are side by side \n   (Perceptual consistency evaluation)\n3. Levels with multiple primitives and multiple resembling objects side by side. \n   (Real-world scaling composition evaluation)\n   \n   \n   Branch Active: [PERSON_NAME_0019]/itemcompositiontest\n   \n   Task 1: Decide Min-Max Threshold \n   \n   We need to decide what's the smallest and largest tap area we allow players on an object from a difficulty and aesthetics standpoint. \n   \n   a. Minimum First \n   \n   The minimum tap area should be visible on the screen. If levels are made out of the smallest tap area objects, it shouldn't look absurd. And it should still be clickable comfortably. \n   \n   b. Maximum Second\n   \n   The max is more straightforward. It shouldn't be big enough that the object looks too out of place especially compared to the decided small item. Think sheriff bagde vs couch. \n   \n   To help decide, these are the test levels (unchecked for prod)\n   \n   1. CylinderMinTapArea\n   \n   Shows beer mugs (bulky cylinder) with 0.2, 0.25, 0.3, and 0.35 script sizing. \n   \n   2. BadgeMinTapArea\n   \n    Show badges (flat small) with 0.25, 0.275, and 0.3 script sizing. \n\n      3\\. RakeMinTapArea\n\n      Rakes in different colors, 0.5,0.6, and 0.7 in script sizing. \n\n      4\\. BeerMaxTap\n      \n Beers in different sizes 0.6, 0.7, and 0.8 in script sizing and a 0.3 beer mug for comparison    and perceptual consistency.\n\n5. CouchMaxTap\n   \n   This is the bulkiest object so it's the ultimate threshold for maximum tap area. This level has couch script sizes 0.75, 0.85, and 0.95 and a 0.3 beer mug for comparison.\n\nTask 2: Decide shape categories (prefab sizing among peers)\n\nEvery item gets a shape label according to these categories \n\n1. Narrow Vertical (fork, pen, wine bottle, billiard stick)\n2. Flat (chocolate, plate, pizza box, badge, music note, letters)\n3. Bulky Polygon (gift box, washing machine, barrel)\n4. Bulky Wide (couch, fridge, bicycle)\n5. Tall Irregular (lamp, plunger)\n\n\nTask 3: Define global min and max for each shape\n\n1. For example the smallest narrow vertical item we will have in the game is a \"rake\"\n2. The smallest flat item we will have in the game is \"badge\"\n\nTask 4: Resize things accordingly.\n\nDon't over adjust", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-04-23T08:55:32Z", "completed_at": "2025-04-30T01:27:54Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 417246, "labels": ["(ZM) Game Design"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-23T08:55:32Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-30T01:27:54Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3741", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-60", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-60", "number": 60, "title": "Zombie Ops #2 Spec (Brain Chase)", "description": "This the collectibles-based LiveOps event, aka **zombie version of Win and Collect.** Working title is Brain Chase with the alternate event name Serum Therapy. \n\nHere are some brain storm jump points for when we are ready to tackle this spec. \n\n* Collectible ideas: brains, tombstones, serums, worms, spiders (cute edition)\n  \n  Iteration idea: If we go with worms and spiders, we can make them moving so player feels like \"catching\" them. Adds to the fun and replays the same emotion in Royal Match where moving blocks of the collectible affects the collectible state. \n\n\n* Brain Chase is a time-limited event consisting of several steps. Each step has its collectible item goal and reward. You collect the items within the level by just tapping them while playing a level.\n  \n  Alternative: We can make it a match 3 to get the collectible item to keep it dynamic, similar to how you have to make a propeller in Royal Match to keep the mechanic one step above the mere collect.\n   \n* When players collect the item goal of a step, they need to finish the level to claim it. Thus, extra collectibles for hard and epic levels. \n  \n  Alternative: Multiply rewards with rewarded ad? \n* The event has progression within itself. When you complete all steps in the event, you win the Grand Prize.\n* Some name ideas: Brain Chase, Serum Therapy, Ghoul Goals, Zombie Zing, Graveyard Dash", "priority": 4, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": "2025-06-23T18:25:14Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 338469, "labels": ["(ZM) Game Design"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-23T11:24:33Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-23T18:25:14Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3770", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-626", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-626", "number": 626, "title": "Zombie Match Lite Master Ticket Main Menu", "description": "The master ticket for the light version of the zombie match. This ticket will include everything related to iteration independent of department.  \n\n[[URL_52963])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165704, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T17:50:45Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:06:58Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3774", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-63", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Done", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-63", "number": 63, "title": "Zombie Ops #4 Quests and Achievements Spec", "description": "Blank spec and excel sheet for the list of quests and achivements\n[[URL_52387])\n[[URL_52386])\n\nList of quests and achievements need to be filled in.", "priority": 3, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-06-23T18:23:18Z", "completed_at": "2025-06-23T18:23:29Z", "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 338471, "labels": ["(ZM) Game Design"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-04-23T17:12:20Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-23T18:23:29Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3780", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-635", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-635", "number": 635, "title": "Zombie Match Lite Master Ticket LiveOps", "description": "Everything concerning liveops in the new iteration lorem ipsum", "priority": 0, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165038, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:23:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T04:56:45Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3781", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-636", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-636", "number": 636, "title": "Zombie Match Lite Master Ticket Live Ops", "description": "Everything concerning LiveOps portion of the iteration", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165547, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:27:13Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:18:11Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3784", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-639", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Todo", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-639", "number": 639, "title": "Redo rewards that were previously card packs", "description": "When redoing the economy replace all card pack placements with new things. Dependent on economy changes as a whole, details TBD. \n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165545, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:29:09Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T14:01:09Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3786", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-640", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "In Progress", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-640", "number": 640, "title": "Remove anything zombie from quests and achievements", "description": "Please go through the list of quests of achievements. Detect any quests or achievements related to the zombie killings, boss busters, cards etc (anything related to the zombies) and assess what we are left with. After this task move on with the secondary task: \n\n[ZOM-641](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-641/add-quests-and-achievements-specific-to-the-new-iteration)\n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-22T17:52:57Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 164261, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ZOM-641", "type": "relates"}, {"target": "ZOM-663", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:29:25Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:52:57Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3787", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-641", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": "ZOM-636", "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "In Progress", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-641", "number": 641, "title": "Add Quests and Achievements Specific to the New Iteration", "description": "Please create new quest and achievement ideas related to the new iteration. Make sure we have an acceptably long list and consult with [PERSON_NAME_0022] and Douglas on how long it would take to add them in. Share your cost estimation in the low-fat-zombie-match channel for assessment. After product approval, make the new Excel sheet and move with the rest of the production. \n\nGDD Folder Link:\n[[URL_52967])", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": "2025-10-22T17:53:00Z", "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 164261, "labels": ["Lite"], "links": [], "relations": [{"target": "ZOM-640", "type": "relates"}, {"target": "ZOM-663", "type": "relates"}], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:29:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T17:53:00Z"}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "pointer": "/issues/3790", "field": "assignee_id", "value": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "record": {"id": "ZOM-644", "project_id": "dbab77c7-f871-4888-abf8-d98b52a41624", "team_id": "team_ZOM", "parent_id": null, "assignee_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "creator_id": "usr_8140f09bf9f1b94c", "state_id": "Backlog", "cycle_id": null, "identifier": "ZOM-644", "number": 644, "title": "Zombie Match Lite Master Ticket Core Game", "description": "Everything related to the core game of the lite iteration", "priority": 2, "estimate": null, "due_date": null, "started_at": null, "completed_at": null, "canceled_at": null, "archived_at": null, "time_in_status_minutes": 165541, "labels": [], "links": [], "relations": [], "is_archived": false, "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:33:43Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T14:58:52Z"}}], "records_checked": 3852, "files_selected": 1, "files_completed": 1, "scan_complete": true, "errors": []}}, "files_read_this_call": 1, "sources": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/linear/data.json", "manifest_sha256": "b299d01377efd99db02ba7f6bb072a6d539b00d970b492b9e79b68353d3f5310", "freshness": "582618486f6bf42cadf2f5773c59d065e6e938d2e6a872db0c1e27305c9165fd"}], "scan_complete": true, "persona_filtered": false, "backend": "grouped-record-scan", "scope_note": "Exact direct fields in selected arrays. No SQL is applied. Absence/uniqueness is supported only within complete declared scopes. Manifest hashes are declared provenance, not fresh full-content hashes."}, "checksum": "6110054a41da158cb3227e65e91dd6eec370f4528a724e382abb413abbbce539"}